{"type":"Film","id":"FR2014_110","slug":"fr2014-110-les-combattants","title":{"native":"Les Combattants","english":"Love at First Fight"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2014-08-20","year":2014},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Thomas Cailley","slug":"thomas-cailley","name":"Thomas Cailley","birthYear":1980,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2023-173-le-regne-animal","title":{"native":"Le Règne animal"}},"year":2024,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2014-110-les-combattants","title":{"native":"Les Combattants"}},"year":2015,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Director","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/31/242/127519/format_page/les-combattants.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bi_wDGwQ9ho"},"synopsis":{"native":"Entre ses potes et l’entreprise familiale, l’été d'Arnaud s’annonce tranquille…Tranquille jusqu'à sa rencontre avec Madeleine, aussi belle que cassante, bloc de muscles tendus et de prophéties catastrophiques. Il ne s’attend à rien, elle se prépare au pire. Jusqu'où la suivre alors qu'elle ne lui a rien demandé ? C’est une histoire d’amour. Ou une histoire de survie. Ou les deux.","english":"Between his buddies and the family firm, Arnaud's summer is shaping up to be peaceful... Peaceful until his encounter with Madeleine, as beautiful as she is a pain, a block of tense muscles and catastrophic prophecies. He expects nothing, she's preparing for the worst. He lets himself be carried along, laughs a lot. She struggles, runs, swims, hones herself. Just how far will he follow her, when she's asked nothing of him?"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Brigitte Roüan","slug":"brigitte-rouan","name":"Brigitte Roüan","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gen